  <ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl id="f-37" contextRef="c-1">Respondent is a direct, wholly-owned subsidiary of UGI Energy Services, LLC (&#8220;UGIES&#8221;) and an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of UGI Corporation, a Pennsylvania Corporation.&#160; The Respondent is authorized to conduct business as a foreign limited liability company in the State of Pennsylvania in order to own and operate gas transmission facilities and engage in open-access transportation services within Pennsylvania.</ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl>
