  <ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder id="f-60" contextRef="c-18">The Respondent is a limited liability company formed in 2015 under the laws of the State of Delaware.&#160; As an LLC, the Respondent has not issued shares of stock or other similar securities.&#160; Rather, its equity is in the form of Membership Interests.</ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-61" contextRef="c-18" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">11</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder id="f-62" contextRef="c-19">100% of the Membership Interests of the Respondent, and the right to vote the same, are owned by UGI Energy Services, LLC ("UGIES").</ferc:NameTitleAndAddressOfSecurityHolder>
